GET (read, mapping errors) and DELETE (accepting the same store-error mapping for the lookup step).\", \"Only the existing store sentinels (ErrNotFound, ErrConflict, ErrInvalidID, ErrUserAtCap) are covered; mapStoreError was already correct so it was reused unchanged rather than refactored.\", \"Handler-level behavior is not covered by the delivered tests (session_test.go only exercises the Store), so verification of the new endpoint depends on later pipeline stages.\"], \"language\": \"go\"}","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bdeed40a3ec57f83","runId":"run_20260918155038_db0c03","schemaVersion":2,"type":"tool_call_delta"}
